{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12944","headline":"贾员外处见中书贾舍人巴陵诗集覧之怀旧代书寄赠 · 独孤及","name":"贾员外处见中书贾舍人巴陵诗集覧之怀旧代书寄赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海岸望青琐，云长天漫漫。\n十年不一展，知有关山难。\n适逢阮始平，立马问长安。\n取公咏怀诗，示我江海澜。\n暂若窥武库，森然矛戟寒。\n眼明遗头风，心悦忘朝餐。\n大驾今返正，熊罴扈鸣銮。\n公游凤凰沼，献可在笔端。\n系越有长缨，封关祗一丸。\n冏然翔寥廓，仰望惭羽翰。\n嘉会不我与，相思岁云殚。\n唯当袖佳句，持比青琅玕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12944.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12944","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}